GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`VI.5 — a warranty not complied with during the period` c MEANS
       any (GIVEN w YIELD w's `not complied with during the period of insurance`) (c's `warranties`)
    OR c's `conduct`'s `insured the deductible during the period of the policy`

GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
