    f's `the damage was done by a deliberate act or by sabotage`

-- (b) within 30 days, "hoặc dài hơn nếu được Bảo Minh cho phép bằng văn bản" (or longer if
-- Bao Minh allows it in writing), deliver the written claim, as detailed as possible, item
-- by item with the amount of each loss on the value at the time of loss, with particulars
-- of any other insurance. The Rules do not say when the 30 days start; they are counted
-- from the day of the DAMAGE, the "sự cố" the paragraph opens with (fork F21). A period
-- Bao Minh allows is used only where it is longer than 30 days.
