§§ `VII.2 — forfeiture`

-- (a) Every benefit is forfeited if the claim is fraudulent, if fraudulent means are used
-- by or for the Insured to benefit, or if the DAMAGE was caused by a wilful act, or with
-- the connivance, of the Insured.
