§§ `VII.3 — reinstatement: the Insured's part`

-- Where Bao Minh elects to repair or replace, the Insured must at its own expense supply
-- the plans, documents, technical schemes, quantities, dimensions and other information
-- needed when Bao Minh asks; and Bao Minh is not taken to have elected unless it acts, or
-- asks for acts, that show the election. The measure is in bmfire-indemnity.l4.
