§§ `VII.4 — Bao Minh's rights after a loss`

-- Bao Minh or its agent may, without liability and without prejudice to its rights,
-- (a) enter the scene to assess the loss or take over the building, and (b) take over
-- insured property, or require it to be handed over, to deal with it as is proper. No
-- period. And the Insured may not abandon its property to Bao Minh, whether or not Bao
-- Minh has taken it over.
