§§ `VII.7 — subrogation`

-- At its own expense Bao Minh may require the Insured to take, join in, or allow, the
-- steps necessary and reasonable to enforce rights of recovery against third parties,
-- before or after Bao Minh pays. On the preamble, a condition precedent; the Law on
-- Insurance Business, art. 54(1)(b), lets the insurer only deduct from the indemnity by
-- the Insured's fault where the Insured refuses to transfer the right (LAW).
