§ `VIII.3 — the premium payment warranty`

-- 1. Whatever may be contrary to it, and subject to clause 2, the condition precedent to
-- Bao Minh's liability under a policy, renewal certificate, endorsement or cover note is
-- that the Insured pays the premium in full, to Bao Minh, its agents or brokers:
-- (a) within 30 days from (i) the day cover was accepted under the policy, renewal
-- certificate or cover note; (ii) the day an endorsement's cover takes effect, where that
-- is on or after the day it is issued; (iii) the day an endorsement is issued, where its
-- cover takes effect earlier; or (b) where Bao Minh accepts instalments, the first within
-- 30 days from the day cover was accepted (or an endorsement's cover took effect), the rest
-- on the days agreed in the policy; or (c)
-- "khi thời hạn thanh toán phí bảo hiểm dưới 30 ngày" (when the premium payment term is
-- under 30 days), within the period of insurance.
