-- src:482 | nhận tái tục, Sửa đổi bổ sung hay Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm tạm thời sẽ bị hủy bỏ và Bảo
-- src:483 | Minh chỉ chịu trách nhiệm trong khoảng thời gian các văn bản trên có hiệu lực đến ngày bị
-- src:484 | hủy bỏ.
--
-- READING TAKEN (fork F27). Clause 1 is
-- "phụ thuộc và không phương hại đến điều khoản số 2" (subject to and without prejudice to
-- clause 2), and clause 2 keeps Bao Minh liable for
-- the period in force. So a premium not paid in time cancels the cover from the day after
-- its deadline, and DAMAGE on or before that deadline stays covered. The Law on Insurance
-- Business, art. 27(1)(c), says the same of property insurance terminated for unpaid
-- premium (LAW). The two other readings, the preamble's (no cover until paid) and clause
-- 1's read alone (no liability at all unless paid in time), are encoded below as
-- `preamble — the premium required had been paid before the DAMAGE` and
-- `VIII.3.1 — the condition precedent, read without clause 2` (finding X9).

§§ `VIII.3 — the deadlines`

GIVEN p IS A `The premium`
      s IS A `The Policy Summary`
GIVETH A DATE
`VIII.3.1 — the last day to pay the premium, or its first instalment` p s MEANS
    CONSIDER p's `an agreed premium payment term, in days`
    WHEN JUST n THEN
        IF   n LESS THAN 30
        THEN s's `end of the period of insurance`                -- (c)
        ELSE p's `date cover was accepted` PLUS 30               -- (a)(i), (b)(i)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN p's `date cover was accepted` PLUS 30      -- (a)(i), (b)(i)

GIVEN e IS AN `An endorsement`
GIVETH A DATE
`VIII.3.1(a)(ii)-(iii) — the last day to pay an endorsement's premium` e MEANS
    IF   e's `date its cover takes effect` AT LEAST e's `date of issue`
    THEN e's `date its cover takes effect` PLUS 30               -- (a)(ii)
    ELSE e's `date of issue` PLUS 30                             -- (a)(iii)

-- Paid on or before a deadline.
GIVEN `the day paid` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the deadline` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`VIII.3 — paid by` `the day paid` `the deadline` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the day paid`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST d  THEN d AT MOST `the deadline`

-- Each payment the warranty asks for, with its deadline: the premium in full, or under
-- (b) the first instalment by the 30-day deadline and each later one on its agreed day.
GIVEN p IS A `The premium`
      s IS A `The Policy Summary`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An instalment of premium`
`VIII.3 — the payments and their deadlines` p s MEANS
    IF   p's `Bao Minh accepted payment in instalments`
    THEN CONSIDER p's `instalments`
         WHEN EMPTY              THEN EMPTY
         WHEN i FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
             (`An instalment of premium` WITH
                  `agreed date` IS `VIII.3.1 — the last day to pay the premium, or its first instalment` p s
                  `date paid`   IS i's `date paid`)
             FOLLOWED BY rest
    ELSE LIST (`An instalment of premium` WITH
                   `agreed date` IS `VIII.3.1 — the last day to pay the premium, or its first instalment` p s
                   `date paid`   IS p's `date the premium was paid in full`)

-- Clause 2: the policy's cover is cancelled from the day after a deadline that was missed;
-- DAMAGE on or before that deadline is within the period in force.
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`VIII.3.2 — the cover was cancelled for unpaid premium before the DAMAGE` c MEANS
    any (GIVEN i YIELD     i's `agreed date` LESS THAN c's `date of the DAMAGE`
                       AND NOT (`VIII.3 — paid by` (i's `date paid`) (i's `agreed date`)))
        (`VIII.3 — the payments and their deadlines` (c's `premium`) (c's `Policy Summary`))

-- The same, for an endorsement the claim relies on: only the endorsement's cover goes.
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`VIII.3.2 — an endorsement relied on was cancelled for unpaid premium before the DAMAGE` c MEANS
    any (GIVEN e YIELD     `VIII.3.1(a)(ii)-(iii) — the last day to pay an endorsement's premium` e LESS THAN c's `date of the DAMAGE`
                       AND NOT (`VIII.3 — paid by` (e's `date its premium was paid in full`) (`VIII.3.1(a)(ii)-(iii) — the last day to pay an endorsement's premium` e)))
        (c's `endorsements relied on`)

-- Clause 1 read without clause 2 (the reading NOT taken; for finding X9): no liability
-- unless every payment was made by its deadline.
GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`VIII.3.1 — the condition precedent, read without clause 2` c MEANS
    all (GIVEN i YIELD `VIII.3 — paid by` (i's `date paid`) (i's `agreed date`))
        (`VIII.3 — the payments and their deadlines` (c's `premium`) (c's `Policy Summary`))

-- The duty, for #TRACE: the clock counts days from the day cover was accepted.
GIVEN `days to pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the policy` `An act under the policy`
`VIII.3 — the Insured must pay the premium in full` `days to pay` MEANS
    PARTY  `the Insured`
    MUST   `pay the premium in full`
    WITHIN `days to pay`
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the Insured`
           BECAUSE "VIII.3.2: the premium was not paid in full within the premium payment warranty period; the cover is cancelled, and Bao Minh is liable only for the period in force up to cancellation"
